[{"stream_name":"stdout","time":0.970900341,"data":"LongVid-OV step 4 plan\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":0.970950125,"data":"  A. install optimum-intel==2.2.0, nncf, diffusers==0.39.0, then --pre openvino openvino-tokenizers openvino-genai from https://storage.openvinotoolkit.org/simple/wheels/nightly\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":0.97095796,"data":"  B. INT8 model from Lightricks/LTX-Video: 1a optimum-cli -\u003e 1b optimum API bf16 -\u003e 2 component-wise -\u003e 3 MX69Moi/LTX_Video_i2v_ov; watchdog kill at 28.0 GB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":0.970963304,"data":"  C. Text2Video 512x320: 25 frames / 8 steps, then 49 frames / 20 steps (seed 42)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":0.97096778,"data":"  D. long video: 3..8 chained windows (T2V, then I2V on the last frame), seams + drift\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":0.970972288,"data":"  E. tiled vs untiled decode of the long latents, length x[1, 2, 4]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":0.970976575,"data":"  F. report, manifest, model folder if \u003c 12.0 GB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":0.970981076,"data":"  budget 9.5 h, 20 min reserved for F\n"}
